we have a problem. We have two DEC machines in the following
configuration:


--------------                           ----------
|DEC 5000/240| <---------[X25]----------> |DEC ??? |
|ULTRIX 4.2  |                            |OSF 1   |
--------------                           ----------

Both computers have their own subnets at both ends of the X25-link.

What we can do:

- We can ping, ftp, telnet the ULTRIX machine from the OSF machine.
- We can also ping any PC in the subnet of the ULTRIX.
- We can also ping any PC in the subnet of the OSF from the ULTRIX!

