and run on some Alpha's under Digital Unix. Using OS 3.0 and Fortran 3.5,
we had no problems. After upgrading to OS 3.2 and Fortran 3.7, we get
the following odd error at link time:

Assertion failed: 
  0, file ../../../../../../src/usr/ccs/lib/libmld/cmrlc_produce.c, line 864
Fatal error in: /usr/lib/cmplrs/cc/ld IOT/Abort trap 
