error is odd, in that it seems to depend on array dimensions and such. In
particular, by making some arrays larger than usual, I can make the error
go away (with a performance hit, since the large arrays are then "out of
cashe" alot of the time...). I'm pretty sure it's not my fault, since this
code is pretty mature and runs with only trivial changes on all the usual
Unix workstations, VMS, pc's, mac's, etc.

