Hi,

It doesn't look like you got an answer yet, so, from the service manual in my hand,
the banks are interleaved.  Ignore the spacing of the simm slots.   A picture is
worth a thousand words:

	simm slots		bank number

  ===================		0
  ===================		1

  ===================		0
  ===================		1
  ===================		0
  ===================		1

  ===================		0
  ===================		1

Make sense?  Two banks of four simms.  If bank 0 was full and bank 1 was empty, you
would have a simm in every other slot. 

