The following is an example entry for the RS/6000 530:

size of cache line:	128 bytes
size of data cache:	64 kbytes
associativity:		4-way

TLB:			128 entries
associativity:		2-way
page size:		4096 bytes

load-instruction:
1st level cache hit:	1 cycle
1st level cache miss,
TLB page hit:		1 cycle
			+ 8 cycles for first 16 bytes (*)
			+ 7 cycles for remaining 128-16 bytes
TLB page miss:		same as TLB page hit
			+ 40-60 cycles to calculate real page address

