NT in general does not support multi-headed displays (at least not as 
of NT 3.5).  I suppose that a custom driver could lie to NT and tell 
it it had a single display with, say, 2560x1024 pixels, and parcel out 
the display updates to two different physical cards, but NT doesn't 
have this capability out of the box.  

