Truth be told, the problem with Alpha LEAN is pricing, not heat 
dissipation. I had the opportunity to test a prototype LEAN in December 
'93; turns out that the greatest source of heat from the system was from 
the battery when it was in recharge mode.  LEAN incorporated a 166MHz 
LC-A chip which would run as slow as 25MHz when power management was 
turned on.  


