Our 2250 is attached to the other end of a 9600 baud line on a terminal
server. As you can imagine, it takes ages to print a large bitmap from
Windows NT (or anywhere, really). The same probably goes for yours as well.
On the other hand, your NT systems might print directly over the network
to the 4si, resulting in a huge speed increase: the spool file is still
enormous, but it disappears so fast you just don't see it.

You'd have to give more information about your setup.

> Any info appreciated... well almost any info.  :-)
