up with point-click-curse interfaces, or if you want to extend the 
power of the command line, this program is for you. UC is easy to 
learn, and also has full context sensitive help and an online 
tutorial built-in. Everything is contained in a single small and 
fast executable that runs well even on older Unix machines. 

UC, tested at over a hundred beta sites, has an aggressively low 
introductory price of $50 per license. We want this program to run 
on every Unix machine on the planet. To get started straight away, 
ftp to ftp.uu.net and change to directory /vendor/UniX11/dec-alpha. 
