>It seems as if all Dec hard drives need a start up command. 
>Does anyone know how to manualy set jumpers to negate the 
>need for the start up command.

For the DEC DSP3085, DSP3105, DSP3105D, DSP3210 and DSP3160 hard disk 
drives, a jumper across pins 14 and 15 on the options connector (same 
